Agent-native CLIs published by CLI-Anything are executables named `cli-anything-<app>` (gimp, blender, inkscape, libreoffice, audacity, drawio ...)
that speak structured `--json`.  They are ALWAYS preferred over GUI clicking (Layer-0 routing): deterministic, no pixels, verifiable artifacts.

 * discover()   : PATH scan for cli-anything-* (+ cli-hub) - no process is spawned
 * help_text()  : `<tool> --help`
 * run_json()   : run with `--json` (no shell, argv list, timeout), parse the JSON, validate it and VERIFY every artifact path it reports
