"""Async NDJSON IPC (Windows named pipe via the Proactor loop / unix socket on other OS), process supervision with a
KILL_ON_JOB_CLOSE job (children die with Python - no orphaned 800 MB processes), and the DriverHub that gives the
brain ONE interface over: Rust dscu-driver (preferred) | in-process native fallback, plus the TS CDP daemon."""
from __future__ import annotations

