"""Strongly typed mirror of schemas/protocol_v1.json (Pydantic v2).

Rule: observation fields come from live capture only. Anything the peer did not measure stays ``None`` -
this module never invents defaults such as ``cdp_up=True`` or ``uia_controls=None``.
