"""Independent Post-State Verifier.

The model saying `done` is a *claim*, never evidence.  Before a task may finish, this module re-derives programmatic checks from the TASK TEXT
(not from the model's summary) and tests them against the real environment:
  * files   : exists, size > 0, extension magic-number, exact bytes / text containment, sha256 recorded in the StableObject registry
  * browser : live CDP probe of the active tab (URL host / path pattern, title, search-box value, DOM text needles)
  * quota   : targeted list objects (by stable_id) have *really disappeared* from a freshly captured list and the quota count is reached
  * sanity  : no crash window on screen, last action not an unrecovered error
If nothing can be derived the verdict is flagged coverage="none" (explicitly UNVERIFIED, never silently trusted).
"""
